---
export const title = 'Usage';
export const order = 100;
import DemoComponentCard from '../../../../components/DemoComponentCard.astro';
---

<p>
  <code>wc-app-shell</code> is the frame of an app screen. Put a <code>wc-app-bar</code> in the
  <code>header</code> slot, a <code>wc-navigation-drawer</code> in the <code>navigation</code>
  slot, the page in the default slot, and optionally a panel in <code>aside</code> and a bar in
  <code>footer</code>. The shell fills the viewport height (<code>100dvh</code>); the header and
  navigation stay put and only the main region scrolls. The demo sets a fixed height.
</p>

<DemoComponentCard lang={'html'}>
  <wc-app-shell
    id='app-shell-demo'
    style='height: 420px; width: 100%; border: 1px solid var(--color-outline-variant); border-radius: 1rem;'
  >
    <wc-app-bar slot='header'>
      Mail
      <wc-icon-button slot='end' variant='text' shape='round' aria-label='Search'>
        <wc-icon name='search'></wc-icon>
      </wc-icon-button>
    </wc-app-bar>
    <wc-navigation-drawer slot='navigation' open style='--navigation-drawer-width: 240px;'>
      <wc-navigation-drawer-item value='inbox' current>
        <wc-icon slot='icon' name='inbox'></wc-icon>
        Inbox
      </wc-navigation-drawer-item>
      <wc-navigation-drawer-item value='sent'>
        <wc-icon slot='icon' name='send'></wc-icon>
        Sent
      </wc-navigation-drawer-item>
      <wc-navigation-drawer-item value='drafts'>
        <wc-icon slot='icon' name='draft'></wc-icon>
        Drafts
      </wc-navigation-drawer-item>
    </wc-navigation-drawer>
    <div style='padding: 1.5rem;'>
      <h2 style='margin-top: 0;'>Inbox</h2>
      <p>Only this region scrolls.</p>
      <div style='height: 800px; border-radius: 1rem; background: var(--color-surface-container);'></div>
    </div>
    <div slot='aside' style='width: 220px; padding: 1.5rem;'>Message details</div>
  </wc-app-shell>
  <script is:inline>
    const shell = document.querySelector('#app-shell-demo');
    shell.addEventListener('open', function (event) {
      if (event.target === shell) myConsole.log('open');
    });
    shell.addEventListener('close', function (event) {
      if (event.target === shell) myConsole.log('close: ' + event.detail.reason);
    });
  </script>
</DemoComponentCard>

<h3>Landmarks</h3>
<p>
  The shell renders the page landmarks: a <code>&lt;header&gt;</code>, a
  <code>&lt;main&gt;</code>, an <code>&lt;aside&gt;</code> and a <code>&lt;footer&gt;</code> (the
  last two only while they have content). The navigation drawer, rail and bar are navigation
  landmarks already, so the shell marks the navigation region as one only when the slotted content
  is not, such as a plain list of links. The first focusable element is a visually hidden
  <em>Skip to main content</em> link; press Tab in the demo to see it.
</p>
